{"id":93053559478366,"type":"album","name":"The Age of Adz","artist":"Sufjan Stevens","year":2010,"weight":16,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/the-age-of-adz-1.jpg","aoty":77,"aoty_user":85,"sputnik":4.05,"yt":"9cGStUxiLGM","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/sufjan-stevens/the-age-of-adz","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/1956-sufjan-stevens-the-age-of-adz.php","sputnikmusic":"https://www.sputnikmusic.com/album/62703/Sufjan-Stevens-The-Age-of-Adz/"},"desc":"The Age of Adz (pronounced odds) is Sufjan Stevens’ first full-length collection of original songs since 2005’s civic pop opus Illinois. This new album is probably his most unusual, first, for its lack of conceptual underpinnings, and second, for its preoccupation with Sufjan himself. The album relinquishes the songwriter’s former story-telling techniques for more primal proclamations unhindered by concepts: there are few narrative conceits or character sketches; there are no historical panoramas, no civic gestures, no literary maneuvers, no expository illustrations drenched in cultural theory, no scene, setting, conflict, resolution, or denouement. Sufjan has stripped away the fabric of narrative ."},"artist_ref":{"id":180656978243545,"name":"Sufjan Stevens","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":126030611694007,"type":"genre","name":"Art Pop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":310,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":132119653572823,"type":"genre","name":"Progressive Pop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":225,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":55143051280122,"type":"genre","name":"Indietronica","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":225,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":225673814674453,"type":"genre","name":"Glitch Pop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":210,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":185790559365860,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Glitch Pop","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":3,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,